+        case GGML_OP_SQR: {
+            // aclnn has no dedicated square op; implement x^2 = x * x by aliasing
+            // src[1] to src[0]. Save/restore src[1] so repeated graph computation
+            // (flow-matching re-runs the graph every step) does not trip on a
+            // stale src[1] or corrupt the graph.
